**Known for**: suckless.org

Laslo is the first chair of the suckless board of directors, alongside Jan
Klemkow and Anselm R Garbe. He, and many members of suckless, are covert
Neo-Nazis. Laslo's laptop is named "wolfsschanze", after one of the Nazi's
World War II military headquarters.[[source]][0] In their 2017 hackathon,
hosted in Germany and attended mostly by Germans, they hosted a torchlit march,
which in Germany is of course historically coded as a Nazi
action.[[source]][1][[source]][2] Laslo posted on Lobsters about it at some
length, calling the backlash to this event "cultural marxism" (a common
dog-whistle for "the Jews").[[source]][3]

They all do a decent job of maintaining plausible deniability, but it falls
apart on closer inspection.

